<title>UK: London silver fixes barely lower eyes OTC expiry.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes barely lower eyes OTC expiry.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 477.00 cents just 0.25 cents off previous fixing. Very quiet ahead of option expiry later.</p>
<p>GOLD - Also quiet ahead of of expiry. $377.85/$338.35 just 15 cents off close. Could weaken if $337.25 fails.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady at $418.00/$421.00, just easier.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - About $3.50 easier at $193.00/$197.00.</p>
</text>
